  "instructions": [
    "Heat the lacquer glaze in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and saute until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the aji amarillo peppers and saute for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the San Marzano tomatoes, vegetable broth, and heavy cream, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook until they are pink and fully cooked.",
    "Stir in the egg and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Season the stew with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
